return {
    ["\n　　不用意外！我预先知道你会到这里，留下了这封信，其他人看不到。\n　　我赶稿实在抽不开身，麻烦帮我把这本新书带给塔罗会的“月亮”先生。书钱我已经付过了！\n　　“月亮”目前以大地母神教会执事的身份，在金秋湖调查“丰饶污染”事件。你们正好可以借此认识一下。\n　　对了，“月亮”先生是血族，请一定不要叫他“吸血鬼”——那很不礼貌！\n　　附一张他自己很满意的画像，方便你辨认。\n（字迹越来越潦草……似乎没时间写更多了。） "] = "\n　　Don't be surprised! I knew in advance that you would come here and left this letter, others can't see it.\n　　I'm too busy with my manuscript to get away, so please help me bring this new book to Mr. Moon of the Tarot Club. I have already paid for the book!\n　　\"Moon\" is currently investigating the \"Abundance Corruption\" incident at Golden Autumn Lake as a deacon of the Earth Mother Church. You can just happen to get to know each other.\n　　By the way, Mr. Moon is a Sanguine, please don't call him a \"vampire\"—that's very rude!\n　　Attached is a portrait he is very satisfied with, for your identification.\n(The handwriting is getting more and more illegible... seems like there is no time to write more.) ",
    ["\n　　购买人：艾德温·霍克斯男爵\n　　出售方：<Hide id=\"#157\">夜鸦收藏会</>\n　　交易物品：<Hide id=\"#157\">疑思之镜</>\n　　年代：距今约八百年\n　　已知效果：\n　　佩戴后，可短暂提升观察力与记忆能力。持有者能够注意到常人难以察觉的细节，发现环境中的异常信息、矛盾与隐藏线索。\n\n　          <Letter_Highlight> ————警告————</>                        \n　　长期使用后，可能出现以下症状：\n　　持续性的被窥视感。对自身记忆产生怀疑。认知混乱。偶尔察觉视野边缘出现并不存在的人影。\n　　本组织不对使用者产生的任何精神异常负责。若出现严重症状，请立即停止使用并销毁该物品。\n\n<Note_Normal_HW>它让我看到了一些本不该知道的事。</>\n<Note_Normal_HW>好像，有什么东西跟随它进入了宅邸。</>"] = "\n	Purchaser: Baron Edwin Hawkes\n	Seller: <Hide id=\"#157\">Night Raven Collection Society</>\n	Traded Item: <Hide id=\"#157\">Mirror of Suspicion</>\n	Age: Approximately eight hundred years old\n	Known Effects:\n	After wearing it, it can briefly enhance observation and memory. The holder can notice details that are difficult for ordinary people to perceive, discovering abnormal information, contradictions, and hidden clues in the environment.\n\n	          <Letter_Highlight> ————Warning————</>                        \n	After long-term use, the following symptoms may appear:\n	A persistent feeling of being watched. Doubts about one's own memory. Cognitive confusion. Occasionally perceiving figures that do not exist in the periphery of vision.\n	This organization is not responsible for any mental abnormalities caused by the user. If severe symptoms appear, please stop using it immediately and destroy the item.\n\n<Note_Normal_HW>It made me see some things I shouldn't have known.</>\n<Note_Normal_HW>It seems like something followed it into the mansion.</>",
